# Versioned measurement evidence must remain available after Git synchronization.
!**/data/*.log
!**/snapshot/*.so
!**/binaries/*.so
!**/efficient-reference/*.log

# Regenerate these exports from the archived binary; summaries live in manifest.json.
**/data/sass.txt
**/data/resources.txt
**/data/execution-status.json

# Parsed counter summaries are stored in manifest.json; raw CSV remains tracked.
# Existing tracked V0/V1/V2 counter JSON files keep their historical status.
**/data/counters.json
**/efficient-reference/counters.json

# Nsight Systems analysis databases are regenerated from tracked .nsys-rep files.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-journal
